sm75 prefill FlashAttention tile fix: on Turing the query tile is capped at
ncols1 = 32/ncols2, so the gqa_ratio>4 default (ncols2=8) ran prefill with a
4-row query tile and re-read K/V for every query block. ncols2=1 keeps the tile
maximal: +4% prefill at a 32k prompt, +12% at 128k. Adds prefill-shaped FA
correctness cases (20/20 against the CPU reference) and env-gated tuning knobs.

Context and measurements: docs/exec-plans/active/llamacpp-parity.md
("Prefill is MMQ plus attention").

Apply on top of patches/llama-cpp-native-q4-dequant.patch (or on b11050 for the
FA change alone, which is independent of the quantized-KV loader).

